# Large regenerable forensic artifacts stay OUT of git — CLAUDE.md §8 puts the inline
# non-LFS blob threshold at 5 MB, and 97 % of the tracked tree is already generated
# evidence. Every excluded file is recorded with its sha256, size and regeneration
# command in LARGE_ARTIFACTS.md, which IS committed. Restore by re-running the builder.
*.parquet
*.pkl.gz
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Named exclusions above the threshold that are not covered by an extension rule.
g2_replay/receipts/G2_M1_ROWS.json
